            p 식[m_{1} = \frac{M}{N_{A}} = \frac{197.0\,\mathrm{g/mol}}{6.022\times10^{23}\,\mathrm{mol^{-1}}} = 3.27\times10^{-22}\,\mathrm{g}]식
